layout uv

# This file is a TEMPLATE for `.envrc`. It exists to show what belongs
# in `.envrc` — which is tooling setup, nothing else.
#
# Do NOT put component configuration here. `.envrc` is a direnv hook:
# it applies only when a shell's working directory is inside this repo,
# and only when direnv is installed and the file has been allowed. An
# export here is therefore
#
#   - absent for any service launched from another directory (e.g. a
#     launchd plist), so the dev shell and the running service disagree
#     with no error; and
#   - higher precedence than the XDG overlay for every process started
#     from this directory, because Oneiric's source chain puts env vars
#     above all YAML layers (`oneiric/core/config.py`).
#
# Where configuration goes instead:
#
#   - per-machine, non-secret settings -> `~/.config/akosha/local.yaml`
#     (the XDG overlay; e.g. the warm tier's `warm.pg_url` and the cold
#     tier's `region` / `endpoint_url`)
#   - secrets                            -> `~/.config/secrets.env`
#   - component-scoped env overrides     -> `AKOSHA__STORAGE__*`,
#     `AKOSHA__*` (these outrank the XDG overlay by design)
#
# An earlier version of this template exported a Postgres DSN, and the
# copy that resulted was committed with a real password in it. That is
# the failure mode this template now exists to prevent.
